WEBVTT

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:08.330
Who am I?

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.360
Your name is Takuto.

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.830
Why am I here?

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.530
You're here to create new memories.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:20.460
I see.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:27.800
This is the first time I've ever heard her,
but her singing is really good.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:46.960
<i>Many things have happened in</i>
<i>this year since I made my debut.</i>

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:52.730
<i>I encountered many different people,</i>
<i>became friends with them,</i>

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:54.530
<i>and they've helped me</i>
<i>along the way.</i>

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:59.530
<i>This is a very valuable treasure.</i>

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:01.930
Full Moon!

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:29.760
<i>Madoka and I</i>
<i>went through a lot,</i>

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:31.500
<i>but now they're</i>
<i>just good memories.</i>

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:36.530
<i>No...</i>

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:41.730
<i>It may actually be that I was able to</i>
<i>persevere this far because of Madoka.</i>

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:46.400
<i>Ms. Oshige,</i>
<i>thank you very much.</i>

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:49.100
<i>Those are the only words</i>
<i>I can find to tell you.</i>

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:56.730
<i>Grandma, thank you for</i>
<i>coming to hear me sing.</i>

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:00.030
<i>I hope that you will start</i>
<i>to like my singing.</i>

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.330
What's the matter, Takuto?
Are you in pain?

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:34.860
Wait!

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:47.800
<i>Thank you very much.</i>

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:54.430
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I'd like to say to everyone.</i>

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:56.900
Huh? Was that on the schedule?

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.830
<i>This year since my debut has</i>
<i>been a very important time for me.</i>

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:05.530
<i>It was a year in which a very naïve girl</i>
<i>experienced many things.</i>

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:08.900
<i>To me, singing is life itself.</i>

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:10.530
<i>It is a very important thing.</i>

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:14.000
<i>Therefore, in order to protect</i>
<i>something so important,</i>

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:15.630
<i>please indulge my selfishness.</i>

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:22.460
<i>I'm going to be</i>
<i>taking some time off.</i>

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:23.860
- What?
- What?

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:25.260
Hey, hey, what's this about?

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:26.900
She hasn't told us anything
about that.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:28.460
What do you mean?!

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.160
Are you trying to run away from me?

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:31.200
Madoka.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:35.260
<i>Today is the last day that</i>
<i>I will see you all.</i>

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:39.860
<i>I can't tell you the reason.</i>
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:45.630
It's life threatening?

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:47.700
Is that true, Ms. Oshige?

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:51.830
I can't believe it.

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:54.200
<i>But I will make you a promise!</i>

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:56.630
<i>I'll make a comeback someday,</i>

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.900
<i>so that I may meet you</i>
<i>all again one day!</i>

00:05:59.060 --> 00:05:59.730
<i>I will!</i>

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:09.500
Madoka...

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:14.700
We'll be waiting for you, Full Moon!

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:15.760
It's a promise!

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:17.900
Hurry back!

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:21.700
<i>Thank you.</i>
<i>Thank you very much!</i>

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:24.360
<i>My sincere thanks to you all.</i>

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:30.900
<i>Let me sing one last song as</i>
<i>a present to you all.</i>

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:34.100
<i>And to one particular person.</i>

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:34.800
Takuto!

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:36.600
<i>This person is</i>
<i>so important to me.</i>

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:40.500
<i>If he had not been there,</i>
<i>I wouldn't be standing here singing.</i>

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:42.830
No, Takuto!
You can't disappear!

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:45.130
This is Mitsuki's last song!

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:49.130
<i>To that person, with heartfelt thanks...</i>
<i>"Love Chronicle."</i>

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.700
Don't! No, Takuto!

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:02.730
Please don't disappear!

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:09.960
<i>- Why is it that I've forgotten</i>
- No! No!

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:15.500
<i>- how to fall in love?</i>
- No!

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:22.660
<i>Our meeting is the beginning</i>
<i>of our separation.</i>

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:28.960
<i>Somewhere along the line</i>
<i>I started to believe that way.</i>

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:37.660
<i>When the shoelace on</i>
<i>my dirty sneakers came loose,</i>

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:41.130
<i>you tied them for me.</i>

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:48.060
<i>Seeing your bashful smile</i>
<i>under the morning sun,</i>

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:53.800
<i>my heart pounded instantly.</i>

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:56.460
<i>I don't love you just because</i>

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:59.460
- No matter what...I won't let Mitsuki die!
<i>- I want you to love me.</i>

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:06.630
<i>You gave me the courage</i>
<i>to honestly love you.</i>

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:08.000
<i>We will now—</i>

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:10.160
Meroko!

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:14.230
What are you doing, Mitsuki?!
Sing!

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:15.760
B-But...

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:18.800
Everything's fine over here,
so finish singing your song!

00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:21.900
But...Meroko...

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:24.330
Please, Mitsuki.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.160
I want to hear you sing.

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:34.000
<i>You gave me the courage</i>
<i>to honestly love you.</i>

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:40.600
<i>We will now head towards</i>
<i>the dream for tomorrow.</i>

00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:46.660
<i>No matter what happens,</i>
<i>I'll never look away.</i>

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:52.360
<i>I don't love you just because</i>
<i>I want you to love me.</i>

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:59.330
<i>You gave me the courage</i>
<i>to honestly love you.</i>

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:06.060
<i>We will now vow</i>
<i>to the coming journey.</i>

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:17.430
<i>No matter what happens,</i>
<i>I'll never let go off this hand, forever!</i>

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:19.130
Izumi?

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:21.060
That was just
a three-dimensional image.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.860
That was what Meroko wanted.

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.160
<i>And also...</i>

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:44.400
Don't worry, Mitsuki.

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:46.430
Just leave yourself in
the good hands of Dr. Wakaoji.

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:47.300
Okay.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:51.160
Ms. Oshige, where are
Takuto and Meroko?

00:09:51.930 --> 00:09:52.930
I don't know.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:55.860
But they'll be all right.

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:59.760
I am certain that those two will keep watch
over you, Mitsuki,

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:01.000
no matter where they are.

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:02.760
Right?

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:03.700
Yes.

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:12.430
IN SURGERY

00:10:27.030 --> 00:10:27.700
Where's this?

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.460
Are you awake?

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:35.660
Who are you?

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:37.130
I do not have a name.

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:42.000
People have always called me
by different names.

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:47.430
Takuto Kira. You regained your memory
from when you were alive

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.630
and have therefore lost the right
to be a Death Spirit.

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:53.500
Normally, your fate would be
to become a ghost left to wander,

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:55.430
but because you have eaten
the Flower of Forgetfulness,

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:57.500
even that is no longer possible.

00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:59.230
What are you talking about?

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:02.860
You have forgotten even that,
haven't you?

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.530
I don't have the time to
indulge you by chatting.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:08.960
I have things I need to do.

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:10.200
See you.

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:13.460
What is it that you must do?

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:18.100
It's...

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:20.030
Don't you remember?

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:25.460
I... What I want is to save
that girl's life.

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.960
Who do you mean by "that girl"?

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:29.660
That...

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:33.500
I can't remember.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:38.230
Why can't I remember anything?!

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:51.700
Takuto!

00:11:55.260 --> 00:11:56.260
Takuto!

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:59.260
Takuto Kira, Meroko Yui.

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:04.260
Not only did both of you try to
hinder the course of fate,

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:07.130
but you even laid your hands on
the forbidden Flower of Forgetfulness.

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:10.030
This is not something that
can be forgiven.

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:14.760
You will receive punishment
appropriate for your crimes.

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.360
And as for Mitsuki Koyama...

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:21.660
- You're not going to take her life.
- No! Please...not that!

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:24.560
Her blood pressure has
suddenly started dropping.

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:26.500
<i>Three more minutes.</i>

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:29.060
<i>Please hang in there, Mitsuki.</i>

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:31.630
I don't care.
I don't care what happens to me.

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:33.430
But please refrain from that!

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:36.360
What do you think gives you
the right to say something like that?

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.400
I don't know.

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.630
But I'm begging you, please don't
do what you're about to do!

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:45.030
There was a life I wanted to save.

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:46.930
There was someone who
I wanted to save.

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:51.660
I don't remember anything,
but it remains inside here!

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:53.500
It remains inside here!

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:55.500
So please don't kill her!

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:57.360
Please don't take
the life of that girl!

00:12:57.730 --> 00:12:59.900
I will do anything to stop you!

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:03.760
If you wish to do that,
you can no longer be a Death Spirit.

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:05.660
Nor can you become a ghost.

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:07.730
Is that all right with you?

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:08.660
Yes.

00:13:12.130 --> 00:13:12.800
Takuto!

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:14.800
Takuto! Takuto!

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:16.530
Please save Takuto!

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:18.430
Please make me a ghost instead!

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:21.730
This man here cannot
even remember you.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.030
And you still say you wish
to take his place?

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:28.800
Takuto has taught me many things.

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:35.030
What it is to love someone...
and what to do when you love someone.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:39.330
Even now, he is trying to save Mitsuki
even if it means giving up his own life.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:44.900
That's why I would have
no regrets about taking Takuto's place.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.460
Doctor! She's stabilizing.

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:00.330
All right. Continue like this.

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:04.760
Her fate has already been changed.

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:05.630
Huh?

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:08.060
Meroko Yui. Stand up.

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:13.230
I release you from being a Death Spirit.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:16.660
All right...

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:30.160
<i>Eichi!</i>

00:14:31.960 --> 00:14:32.960
<i>Eichi!</i>

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:40.360
<i>Takuto! Meroko!</i>

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:46.460
<i>I'm always being helped by</i>
<i>the two of you, aren't I?</i>

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:51.960
<i>Takuto? Meroko?</i>

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:55.630
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:00.030
<i>No! Don't go, you two!</i>

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:03.830
<i>No! You can't go!</i>

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:10.030
<i>Meroko! Takuto!</i>

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:13.560
Mitsuki!

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:14.360
Mitsuki!

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:17.400
You're awake! What a relief.

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:21.630
Ms. Tanaka, please go get Dr. Wakaoji
and tell him that Mitsuki has woken up.

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:22.700
All right!

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:28.000
I'm so relieved.
You were asleep for one full day.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:33.660
Mitsuki?

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:35.030
Does it hurt somewhere?

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:51.630
Mitsuki? Mitsuki?

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.130
Ma'am?

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:55.860
Mitsuki has gone to the annex.

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:57.200
Again?

00:15:57.730 --> 00:16:00.030
Just when Madoka says
she'll come to visit.

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:07.330
<i>The operation was a success,</i>
<i>so she should be able to speak now.</i>

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:11.160
It seems that the two of them
leaving has given her quite a shock.

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:13.560
<i>Even though Takuto and Meroko</i>
<i>are Death Spirits,</i>

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:15.930
<i>they put their lives on the line</i>
<i>to protect Mitsuki.</i>

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:19.700
<i>From now on,</i>
<i>we must protect Mitsuki.</i>

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:20.730
Yes.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.000
Are you on the phone
with Wakaoji again?

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:24.760
President!

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:27.330
It's great to get all fired up,
but exercise some moderation!

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:30.300
Oh, I'm sorry.
I'll get right back to work!

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:41.460
It looks like she can't see me.

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:42.900
I told you.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.800
I wonder why.

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:49.430
Back then, she wanted to die if
she was going to be in such agony.

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:51.660
I think that's why
they were visible to her.

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:56.100
I wonder where those two
are right about now.

00:16:56.230 --> 00:16:57.230
I have no idea.

00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:59.160
But what is certain is that
we'll never see them again.

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:05.660
Are we going to be punished
in some way?

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:10.060
Continuing to be Death Spirits...
That's our punishment.

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:20.900
That's right.

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.130
I'm giving it to someone who's
just been released from the hospital.

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:24.430
I see. In that case
I'll give you a discount.

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:26.300
Great! Thank you very much.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:28.230
See you later.

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:32.160
Oh my goodness...

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:33.760
What a cute mascot.

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:36.000
He really likes it.

00:17:36.260 --> 00:17:38.760
But he doesn't know why he has it.

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:41.960
It's because he hasn't regained
his memory

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:44.260
after a terrible motorcycle accident
two years ago.

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:46.560
<i>- Now then, it's been six weeks</i>
- Hey! Stop running off your mouth!

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:48.200
<i>- since Full Moon went on a break.</i>
- Sorry, sorry.

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:51.400
<i>Everybody must be worried about her</i>
<i>since we haven't heard any news, right?</i>

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:54.030
<i>So we're doing</i>
<i>a Full Moon Special today!</i>

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:57.160
<i>To start off,</i>
<i>I'd like to wish for her early return.</i>

00:17:57.200 --> 00:18:01.900
<i>Just like the title, I would like her</i>
<i>to grasp a new future.</i>

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:04.160
<i>Here is the new song,</i>
<i>"New Future."</i>

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:29.130
<i>Meroko Yui...</i>
<i>I release you from being a Death Spirit.</i>

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:33.160
<i>You can no longer exist</i>
<i>as a Death Spirit.</i>

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:34.260
<i>All right.</i>

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:37.130
<i>Someone like you who has</i>
<i>been touched by true kindness...</i>

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:40.430
<i>You will become an angel.</i>

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:48.460
<i>M-Me?</i>

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:52.600
<i>And you, Takuto Kira...</i>

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:56.060
<i>The feeling of loving someone</i>

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:58.830
<i>and wanting to protect and</i>
<i>save them is wonderful.</i>

00:18:59.230 --> 00:19:03.030
<i>But there are few who can</i>
<i>truly act on those feelings.</i>

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:06.860
<i>You are one of those few,</i>

00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:11.630
<i>moreover, that girl possessed</i>
<i>the will to avert her fate.</i>

00:19:11.860 --> 00:19:13.730
<i>What do you plan to do with Takuto?</i>

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:17.060
<i>Takuto has not yet become</i>
<i>a real Death Spirit.</i>

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:19.560
<i>I will grant you one more chance.</i>

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:20.360
<i>Huh?</i>

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:30.900
<i>Thank you very much!</i>

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:36.900
<i>However, Takuto will have to undergo</i>
<i>the same test again.</i>

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.530
<i>If the result is the same this time,</i>

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:43.000
<i>Takuto will immediately become</i>
<i>a ghost left to wander.</i>

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:45.400
<i>Takuto will do fine this time.</i>

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:50.830
<i>That's wonderful, isn't it, Takuto?</i>

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:56.000
Huh?

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:58.430
Why am I here?

00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:00.660
Well, I guess it doesn't really matter.

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:20.200
Meroko!

